<section class="careers-opening wrap" aria-labelledby="careers-title">
<div class="careers-opening-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Careers</p>
<h1 id="careers-title">Good work.<br><em>Shared ambition.</em></h1>
<p class="lede">Help build focused products for human potential. Bring your craft to engineering or marketing at Solarity AI, full-time, part-time, or as an intern.</p>
<div class="actions">{{ btn('Explore opportunities', '#opportunities')|safe }}
<a class="text-link" href="/company">Meet the company <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div>
<figure class="careers-team"><ul class="careers-team-grid" aria-label="The team">{% for member in team %}<li>{% if member.portrait %}<img src="{{ member.portrait }}" width="480" height="600" sizes="(max-width: 390px) 50px, (max-width: 560px) 62px, (max-width: 850px) 74px, 105px" alt="{{ member.name }}" decoding="async">{% else %}<span class="careers-team-monogram" role="img" aria-label="{{ member.name }}">{{ member.initials }}</span>{% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}</ul><figcaption><p><strong>The team</strong><span>Engineering and marketing</span></p><a class="text-link" href="/company#team">Meet the team <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></figcaption></figure>
</section>

<section class="career-benefits wrap" aria-labelledby="career-benefits-title">
<div class="career-section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Why join</p><h2 id="career-benefits-title">A place for <em>your contribution.</em></h2></div>
<dl class="career-benefit-list">
<div><dt><span class="career-benefit-icon">{{ symbol('share')|safe }}</span>Generous profit sharing</dt><dd>Share in the value you help create. Discuss the arrangement for your role during the hiring process.</dd></div>
<div><dt><span class="career-benefit-icon">{{ symbol('globe')|safe }}</span>Fully remote</dt><dd>Contribute remotely, with the work and your collaboration at the center of the conversation.</dd></div>
<div><dt><span class="career-benefit-icon">{{ symbol('spark')|safe }}</span>Respect for talent</dt><dd>Bring your perspective, your skills, and the care you put into your work. We want to understand what you can contribute.</dd></div>
</dl></section>

<section class="career-opportunities wrap" id="opportunities" aria-labelledby="career-opportunities-title">
<div class="career-opportunities-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Open roles</p><h2 id="career-opportunities-title">Find your place.</h2></div>
<p>2 disciplines. 1 product direction. Read the role introductions, then tell us where you could contribute.</p></div>
<div class="career-role-list">
{%- for slug, title, discipline, detail in roles -%}
<article class="career-role" aria-labelledby="role-{{ slug|safe }}"><div class="career-role-meta">{{ discipline }}</div><div class="career-role-copy"><h3 id="role-{{ slug|safe }}">{{ title }}</h3><p>{{ detail }}</p><ul class="career-role-tags" aria-label="Work arrangements"><li>Fully remote</li><li>Full-time / Part-time / Internship</li></ul></div><a class="career-role-action" href="/careers?role={{ slug|safe }}#apply" data-career-role="{{ slug|safe }}"><span>Apply<span class="sr-only"> for {{ title }}</span></span><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></article>
{%- endfor -%}
</div>
<div class="career-posters"><p>Want to learn more before applying?</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ posters_url|safe }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View job posters <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only"> on Google Drive, opens in a new tab</span></a></div><div class="career-posters career-programs"><p>Students and event attendees</p><span class="career-program-links"><a class="text-link" href="{{ mentorship_url|safe }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Mentorship program for university students <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only"> on Google Forms, opens in a new tab</span></a><a class="text-link" href="{{ certificate_url|safe }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Certificate of participation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only"> on Google Forms, opens in a new tab</span></a></span></div>
</section>

<section class="career-apply wrap" id="apply" aria-labelledby="career-apply-title">
<div class="career-apply-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Apply</p><h2 id="career-apply-title">Tell us what <em>you bring.</em></h2>
<p>Start with your name, email, and the opportunity you have in mind. A LinkedIn profile or a link to your work can add context, if you have one.</p>

<div class="career-email-alternative"><p>Prefer to contact us directly?</p><a href="mailto:careers@solarityai.com?subject=Career%20inquiry%20-%20Solarity%20AI">careers@solarityai.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{{ copy_button('careers@solarityai.com', 'careers-email-copy-status') }}</div></div>

<form id="career-form" class="career-form" action="https://formsubmit.co/careers@solarityai.com" method="POST" aria-labelledby="career-form-title" aria-describedby="career-form-intro career-disclosure">
<div class="career-form-heading"><h3 id="career-form-title">Introduce yourself.</h3><p id="career-form-intro">4 details to get started. Work links are optional.</p></div>
<input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New Job Application - Solarity AI">
<input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="true">
<input type="hidden" name="_template" value="box">
<input type="hidden" name="_url" value="https://solarityai.com/careers/">
<div hidden><label for="career-honey">Leave this field empty</label><input id="career-honey" type="text" name="_honey" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></div>
<div id="career-errors" class="career-errors" tabindex="-1" hidden><h3>Please check your application.</h3><ul id="career-error-list"></ul></div>
<div class="career-fields">
<div class="career-field"><label for="career-name">Full name</label><input id="career-name" name="fullName" type="text" required minlength="2" maxlength="100" autocomplete="name" aria-describedby="career-name-help career-name-error"><p id="career-name-help" class="career-field-help">Use the name you would like us to address you by.</p><p id="career-name-error" class="career-field-error" hidden></p></div>
<div class="career-field"><label for="career-email">Email address</label><input id="career-email" name="email" type="email" required maxlength="254" autocomplete="email" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="none" aria-describedby="career-email-help career-email-error"><p id="career-email-help" class="career-field-help">Use the address where you would like to hear from us.</p><p id="career-email-error" class="career-field-error" hidden></p></div>
<div class="career-field"><label for="career-position">Position</label><select id="career-position" name="position" required aria-describedby="career-position-help career-position-error"><option value="">Select a position</option>
{%- for slug, title, discipline, detail in roles -%}
<option value="{{ slug|safe }}">{{ title }}</option>
{%- endfor -%}
</select><p id="career-position-help" class="career-field-help">Choose the role you would like to apply for.</p><p id="career-position-error" class="career-field-error" hidden></p></div>
<div class="career-field"><label for="career-work-type">Work arrangement</label><select id="career-work-type" name="workType" required aria-describedby="career-work-type-help career-work-type-error"><option value="">Select an arrangement</option><option value="full-time">Full-time</option><option value="part-time">Part-time</option><option value="intern">Internship</option></select><p id="career-work-type-help" class="career-field-help">Indicate your preference to discuss with the team.</p><p id="career-work-type-error" class="career-field-error" hidden></p></div>
<div class="career-field"><label for="career-linkedin">LinkedIn profile <span>Optional</span></label><input id="career-linkedin" name="linkedin" type="url" maxlength="500" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="none" placeholder="https://www.linkedin.com/in/your-name" pattern="https://((www|[a-z]{2})[.])?linkedin[.]com/in/.+" aria-describedby="career-linkedin-help career-linkedin-error"><p id="career-linkedin-help" class="career-field-help">Your personal LinkedIn profile URL, if useful.</p><p id="career-linkedin-error" class="career-field-error" hidden></p></div>
<div class="career-field"><label for="career-portfolio">Portfolio or relevant work <span>Optional</span></label><input id="career-portfolio" name="portfolio" type="url" maxlength="500" autocomplete="url" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="none" placeholder="https://" pattern="https?://.+" aria-describedby="career-portfolio-help career-portfolio-error"><p id="career-portfolio-help" class="career-field-help">A website, GitHub profile, or work sample. https:// is added if you leave it out.</p><p id="career-portfolio-error" class="career-field-error" hidden></p></div><div class="career-field career-field--wide"><label for="career-note">Where you would contribute <span>Optional</span></label><textarea id="career-note" name="note" rows="4" maxlength="1000" aria-describedby="career-note-help career-note-error"></textarea><p id="career-note-help" class="career-field-help">A few sentences on what you would like to work on. Up to 1,000 characters.</p><p id="career-note-error" class="career-field-error" hidden></p></div>
</div>
<div class="career-form-handoff"><p id="career-disclosure">Your application is addressed to <a href="mailto:careers@solarityai.com">careers@solarityai.com</a>. The next step opens FormSubmit for verification and its submission confirmation. <a href="https://formsubmit.co/privacy.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read FormSubmit’s privacy policy <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only">, opens in a new tab</span></a>.</p>
<button id="career-submit" class="button primary" type="submit">Continue application <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
<p id="career-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p></div>
</form></section>
